# 27. RECOMMENDED STATUS MODEL

Each leaf topic should have:

```text
NOT_STARTED
FIRST_STUDY
REVISION_1
REVISION_2
REVISION_3
REVISION_4
REVISION_5_PLUS
PYQ_DONE
MOCK_TESTED
STRONG
WEAK
```

But do NOT use status as the only measure.

Track these separately:

```text
knowledge_level
recall_level
pyq_level
answer_writing_level
confidence_level
```

A topic can therefore be:

```text
Knowledge: Strong
Recall: Weak
PYQ: Not done
Mains Answer: Not done
```

That is much more useful than simply saying "completed."

