# 29. FORGETTING REGISTER LINK

Each forgetting-register entry should link back to the exact syllabus topic.

Example:

```text
Topic:
POL-1.3.4 Right to Equality

Mistake_Type:
FORGOT

Question_Source:
UPSC Prelims 2024

Mistake:
Confused reasonable classification with arbitrariness.

Correction:
...

Revision_Required:
Yes

Next_Revision:
2026-09-20
```

This makes the tracker capable of answering:

> "Which Polity topics am I repeatedly forgetting?"

rather than merely:

> "Have I studied Polity?"

