# 30. THE CORE PRINCIPLE FOR YOUR TRACKER

Do NOT build a tracker that answers:

> "How much have I studied?"

Build one that answers:

> "How exam-ready am I on every syllabus topic?"

The ultimate dashboard should therefore be able to show:

```text
SYLLABUS COVERAGE
RETENTION
PYQ COVERAGE
PYQ ACCURACY
MOCK PERFORMANCE
FORGETTING RATE
REVISION FREQUENCY
MAINS ANSWER COVERAGE
SOCIOLOGY ANSWER COVERAGE
ETHICS CASE STUDY COVERAGE
```

This is the structure that will be most useful for your particular preparation, because your historical problem has not been syllabus completion. It has been **recall + testing + conversion of knowledge into marks**.

